parate states " }}{EXCHG {PARA 256 "> " 0 "" {MPLTEXT 1 0 880 "for n1 \+
from 0 to NumPoint1 do\nfor n3 from 0 to NumPoint3 do\nfor nA from 0 t
o NumPointA do\n\n    R12:=  Rmin1+Delta1*n1:\n    R32:=  Rmin3+Delta3
*n3:\n    alpha:=Amin +DeltaA*nA:\n\n    Q1:= (R12-RE12)/ab:\n    Q2:=
 (R32-RE32)/ab:\n    Q3:= (alpha-evalf(Pi)):\n    Alpha:=alpha*180.0/e
valf(Pi):\n\n    Poten[n1,n2,n3]:=Hartree*(\n       C000+C200*Q1**2+C1
10*Q1*Q2+C020*Q2**2+\n        C300*Q1**3+C210*Q1**2*Q2+C120*Q1*Q2**2+C
030*Q2**3+\n        C400*Q1**4+C310*Q1**3*Q2+C220*Q1**2*Q2**2+\n      \+
  C130*Q1*Q2**3+C040*Q2**4+\n        C002*Q3**2+C102*Q1*Q3**2+C012*Q2*
Q3**2+\n        C202*Q1**2*Q3**2+C112*Q1*Q2*Q3**2+C022*Q2**2*Q3**2+\n \+
       C004*Q3**4+C006*Q3**6):\n\n     fprintf(File_pot,`%5.2f      %5
.2f     %6.2f %16.8f  1.0  0  \\n`,R12,R32,Alpha,Poten[n1,n2,n3]):\n#p
rint(R12,R32,alpha,Poten[n1,n2,n3])\n\nod:\nod:\nod:\n\n\n#fprintf(Fil
e_pot,`print(%a);\\n`,`        Done!        `):\nclose(File_pot);\n" }
